	<section_number>38.2-1210</section_number>
	<catch_line>Contracts executed by attorney</catch_line>
	<text>
		Reciprocal insurance contracts shall be executed by the attorney of the reciprocal.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 38-545; 1952, c. 317, § 38.1-699; 1986, c. 562.</history>
